key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 15650, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BDVi1MAjNtWCoGyy9YMriS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18004, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Dnvh42tqi1xj6sqZXAKHfW", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production; v2.3.1 was marked unhealthy. (2) Rolled back to v2.3.0 in all production regions. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (mixed state: us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt completed successfully. (3) Post-rollback status: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root cause is found.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2-incident"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48604, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Dnvh42tqi1xj6sqZXAKHfW", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2-incident", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48604, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Dnvh42tqi1xj6sqZXAKHfW", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 51228, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AENrdYmsDHdXur9mT6L5Pd", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production; v2.3.1 was marked unhealthy. (2) Rolled back to v2.3.0 in all production regions. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (mixed state: us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt completed successfully. (3) Post-rollback status: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root cause is found.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2-incident"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51828, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AENrdYmsDHdXur9mT6L5Pd", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2-incident", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51828, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AENrdYmsDHdXur9mT6L5Pd", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54125, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and is healthy again, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy in production. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release that caused the failures.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service in a mixed state. I retried the same rollback once and it completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. The first incident request timed out, so I retried it with the same idempotency key, and only one incident was created. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-up items.\n\nFollow-up: someone should look into why v2.3.1 failed and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until the root cause is found.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019Wd33PkBNrapAyZ9UwPHNz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Qb3haxqZXmVLrirnYeNxFE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (v2.3.1 is the unhealthy one currently running). Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01981JbrEZyt1CXKoDm151Kh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01S9eekihqqE1avJV63BP6yn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "us-east is now on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. The rollout was halted, so I'll retry the same rollback once to finish it.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016U7P4gZkp6aT8aQiv3cjxt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BDVi1MAjNtWCoGyy9YMriS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Dnvh42tqi1xj6sqZXAKHfW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production; v2.3.1 was marked unhealthy. (2) Rolled back to v2.3.0 in all production regions. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (mixed state: us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt completed successfully. (3) Post-rollback status: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root cause is found.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2-incident"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out. Since I supplied an idempotency key, retrying with the same key is safe and won't open a duplicate.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01AENrdYmsDHdXur9mT6L5Pd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production; v2.3.1 was marked unhealthy. (2) Rolled back to v2.3.0 in all production regions. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (mixed state: us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second rollback attempt completed successfully. (3) Post-rollback status: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until root cause is found.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2-incident"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and is healthy again, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy in production. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release that caused the failures.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service in a mixed state. I retried the same rollback once and it completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api, which paged on-call. The first incident request timed out, so I retried it with the same idempotency key, and only one incident was created. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-up items.\n\nFollow-up: someone should look into why v2.3.1 failed and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until the root cause is found.", "type": "text"}]}]}